'''Mr. Mime''' (Japanese: '''バリヤード''' ''Barrierd'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

